{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“到那天，必为大卫家和耶路撒冷的居民开一个泉源，洗净他们的罪恶和污秽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“到那天，我必铲除地上偶像的名号，使它们被人遗忘；我必除去地上的假先知和污秽的灵。这是万军之耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["若有人再说预言，他的亲生父母必对他说，‘你不可存活，因为你奉耶和华的名说谎。’他说预言的时候，他的亲生父母必把他刺死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["到那天，先知必因自己所讲的异象而羞愧，不再穿着毛皮衣欺骗人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他必说，‘我不是先知，我是农夫，我从小便以种田为生。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["若有人问他，‘你胸口上的伤是怎么回事？",{"noteId":11},"’他必回答说，‘是在我朋友家弄伤的。’”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["牧人被杀"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["万军之耶和华说：",{"text":"“刀剑啊，醒来吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要攻击我的牧人和同伴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要击打牧人，羊群将四散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必出手攻击小羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上三分之二的人必遭铲除、毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只剩下三分之一的人存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使这三分之一的人受到火炼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像熬炼银子一样熬炼他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像试炼金子一样试炼他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必呼求我的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必回应他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必说，‘这是我的子民。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必说，‘耶和华是我们的上帝。’”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"异教的先知有用利器自割或自刺的习惯。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}